{
  "about": "Settings Storelib adds to this theme's Theme settings in the builder. Storelib writes this file on every Push, so a change to it is not taken. Their values are in config/settings.json under \"shopify\", beside the theme's own, with the default written out where none was chosen; change a value there and push.",
